    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HQBWQSVB1G2W2RSVZ06XEF5N\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to customize the footer of your emails to best suit your business needs.</p>\n<p>Please note that by default, all free email accounts include Klaviyo branding in their email footers. However, all customers on <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360050759151\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">paid profile and email plans</a> will automatically have Klaviyo's branding removed.</p>\n<p>This guide addresses how to adjust the default Klaviyo branding in email templates. For assistance with editing the content in your templates, head to our <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/4407911841435\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Guide to the email template editor</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HQBWQSVBXK741FB4YXCSGQ4D\">Update branding in your email footers</h2>\n<p>For free accounts, the Klaviyo logo will appear at the bottom of all emails.</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28717849899163\" alt=\"Klaviyo logo footer.jpg\" width=\"642\" height=\"77\"></p>\n<p>To choose a different style for your default Klaviyo branding:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click on your organization name in the bottom left corner of Klaviyo.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Settings</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/31422153062171\" alt=\"The Organization name selected in the bottom left corner showing a menu of settings options.\">\n</li>\n<li>Select the <strong>Email</strong> tab.</li>\n<li>In the <em>Sender information</em> section, select 1 of 4 options to tailor the Klaviyo branding to your preferred style.</li>\n<li>To apply your chosen style, click <strong>Save</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/31422153066523\" alt=\"The Sender Information menu on the Email settings page showing the 4 different default branding options of the Klaviyo logo.\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>For more guidance on upgrading or changing your account's plan, see <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/8356575957275\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to change your plan in Klaviyo</a>. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HQBWQSVBRQHA7T8J5C0AWDWM\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Read an article: <a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000976672\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Understand how Klaviyo billing works</a>\n</li>\n<li>Take a course: <a href=\"https://academy.klaviyo.com/guide-to-building-a-brand-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Building a brand voice</a>\n</li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
